Accept team creation and wait up to five minutes for execution and a fresh Ready namespace observation. Use --no-wait to return the accepted operation immediately. Accepted teams remain when provisioning retries or the wait ends.

Usage:
  mcp-runtime team create [slug] [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help                     help for create
      --idempotency-key string   Reuse this key to recover the same acceptance after a lost response
      --json                     Print the accepted team and operation as JSON
      --name string              Display name for the team (defaults to slug)
      --no-wait                  Return the accepted operation without waiting for namespace readiness

Global Flags:
      --debug   Enable debug mode with structured error logging
